{{ver|37}}
*Fixed Abilities or sources that could cleanse Status Effects unintentionally triggering Blast Detonate damage.

{{ver|36.0.8}}
*Fixed entering Bleedout (instead of the intended Spectral form) with Dagath’s Grave Spirit active if the fatal blow dealt Blast damage.

{{ver|36.0.5}}
*Fixed Clients receiving self-damage from enemies dying from Blast’s detonation AoE.
*Fixed a crash caused by Blast Status Effects. 
*Fixed some rare crashes when hitting Blast’s max stack count on enemies who are liable to become immune to Status Effects on damage.
*Fixes towards a crash caused by Blast Damage Status Effect. 

{{ver|36.0.4}}
*Drastically reduced VFX from Blast Procs to address performance issues.
**This is a temporary change in response to reports of crashes and overall performance issues. Unfortunately this does not fix the issue completely, but it should help improve the situation until it can be addressed properly in a Cert update. 

{{ver|36.0.3}}
*Fixed Clients receiving self-damage from enemies dying from Blast’s detonation AoE.
*Fixed a crash caused by Blast Status Effects. 
*Fixed some rare crashes when hitting Blast’s max stack count on enemies who are liable to become immune to Status Effects on damage. 

{{ver|36.0.2}}
*Fixed Blast Status Effects causing performance drops and crashes.

{{ver|36.0.1}}
*Fixes towards a crash caused by Blast Damage Status Effect.

{{ver|36}}
;Simplified Faction Resistances
*Corpus Amalgam:
**Resistant to '''Blast'''
*Deimos Infested:
**Vulnerable to '''Blast'''

;Status Effect Reworks

'''Blast'''

Our goal with Blast is to invoke an immediate and on-death effect to emphasize explosions. 

Now, instead of enemy inaccuracy, you '''detonate''' your enemies! When dealing a Blast Status Effect to an enemy, the following will happen:

'''Blast Changes:'''
*Upon inflicting a Blast Status Effect, individual stacks will cause a mini-explosion, and a max stack count of 10 will inflict combined damage in a 5m radius
**After 1.5 seconds, an individually incurred Blast Status Effect deals a percentage of base-inflicted damage per stack-explosion and over 100% of base-inflicted damage for a full (10 stack) explosion.
*Status Duration will increase the delay before the Status Effect applies and depletes.
*Removed the previous Status Effect of inaccuracy.

{{ver|35}}
*Fixed the HUD filling up with Blast icons if hit with Blast Damage while riding Merulina.

{{ver|30.8}}
*Made FX improvements to Blast proc explosions.

{{ver|27.2}}
*Status proc changed from "Knockdown" to "Inaccuracy".
**Grants the Blast Status Effect a single target. Blast Status reduces enemy accuracy by 30% base. Subsequent Blast Status Effects add +5% inaccuracy for for 75% total at 10 stacks. Each Blast Status has a 6 second Duration.

{{ver|11}}
*Introduced.
