'''{{D|Impact}} Damage''' is one of the three physical damage types. Deals increased damage to {{D|Grineer}}, {{D|Kuva Grineer}}, {{D|Scaldra}}, and {{D|Anarchs}} enemies. Its status effect causes enemies to stagger and increase [[Parazon]] mercy threshold.

==[[Status Effect]]s==
===General===
The status effect of {{D|Impact}} damage is '''[[Stagger]]'''. It lasts '''6''' seconds and stacks to a maximum of '''5''' times. Any stacks applied after the 5th will replace the oldest stack.
*It causes enemies to flinch and recoil backwards. Subsequent procs increase the stagger duration. However, [[Osprey]]s, [[Bosses]] and [[Tenno]] are immune to the stagger.
*Against heavy units (all humanoid [[Eximus]], [[Heavy Gunner]], [[Bombard]], [[Scrambus]] and [[Comba]], [[Nullifier Crewman]], [[Ancient Disruptor]], [[Ancient Healer]], and [[Toxic Ancient]]), {{D|Impact}} additionally increases the health threshold at which they can be [[Parazon]] Mercy Killed by '''8%''' per proc, allowing them to be vulnerable at up to '''80%''' ('''100%''' on Corpus and Eximus with all their shields removed) of their total health.

Enemies killed by an {{D|Impact}} proc will have their corpse ragdolled and flown away, regardless of the amount of force behind the weapon.

===Railjack===
{{Quote|Railjack <DT_IMPACT>Impact Damage results in a Concuss Status Effect which reduces the aim and damage of enemy ships.|In-Game Description}}
The status effect of {{D|Impact}} damage against [[Railjack]] space enemies is '''Concuss''', causing enemy crew within a gunship to have reduced aim and damage for '''6''' seconds, with subsequent procs refreshing the duration.

