{{Codex|Long believed lost, the mighty Daikyu Prime was the pride of many a Tenno Dojo. The strength demanded to draw it is repaid in added range and power.}}
'''Daikyu Prime''' is the [[Prime]]d counterpart of the {{Weapon|Daikyu}} heavy bow, with enhancements to its already high damage, [[Critical Chance]], [[Critical Multiplier]], and [[Status Chance]]. It also does not need to be fully charged to fire, and has increased critical chance against [[Enemy Body Parts|weak points]]. Daikyu Prime was released alongside {{WF|Yareli Prime}} and {{Weapon|Kompressa Prime}}.

==Characteristics==
*This weapon primarily deals {{D|Puncture}} damage.
*Can be fired after charging for at least 25% of maximum charge, but with reduced damage.
*Forced {{D|Impact}} status effect on both charge levels.
**Can fully benefit of {{M|Internal Bleeding}}.
*Shots have an innate 3 meter [[punch through]], the highest of all bows.
*[[Enemy Body Parts|Weak point]] hits have '''+250%''' [[Critical Chance]] bonus.
**Bonus stacks additively with mods like {{M|Point Strike}} and {{M|Primary Acuity}}.
*On kill, bodies will follow the arrow that killed them, damaging anyone in their path and pinning the corpse to walls.
*Medium-to-high [[zoom]] level when aiming.
*Can equip the bow-exclusive {{M|Thunderbolt}} mod, and the Daikyu-exclusive {{M|Spring-Loaded Broadhead}} and {{M|Amalgam Daikyu Target Acquired}} mods.
*[[Fire rate]] mods apply double their bonuses.
*Innate two {{Pol|Madurai}} polarities.

